  "review_policy": "The baseline contains only fingerprints, line hashes, and redacted classification metadata. It never contains matched values. Commit-bound history fingerprints cannot suppress a finding introduced by a new commit. Current-tree false positives are removed only from a temporary scan snapshot after the exact reviewed source line passes SHA-256 verification; any line change fails closed and requires re-review.",
